# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# The scripts in scripts/ and platforms/*/scripts/ run on Linux hosts, and a
# shell script with CRLF line endings fails with "bad interpreter: no such file
# or directory" -- a confusing error for an obvious cause. Development happens
# on Windows, so this is not hypothetical.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
